SUMMARY:July Movie Night!  Placeholder Not Finalized
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nDune pt 3 (https://www.youtube.
 com/watch?v=3_9vCamtuPY) is scheduled to come to theaters this December\, 
 so I plan on showing:\n\nDune pt 1 and pt 2\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube
 .com/watch?v=8g18jFHCLXk\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Way9De
 xny3w\n\nOr\, as attendees wish\, we can show:\n\nDune (1984)\n-Trailer- h
 ttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hzUlXEyvJeA\n\nBattle of Algiers\n-Trailer-
  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vhhoS3zOskE\n\nGirls of the Sun\n-Trailer
 - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sd5l-XAPdVc\n\nWhen the Moors Ruled in E
 urope\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f2x_VEO3PHA\n\nAnd many\,
  many more! Bring your own film selections and we may decide to show them!
 \n\nAdmission is Free! Bring as many family members and friends as you wou
 ld like! Please RSVP! Discussion after the movie(s)\, hang out and share y
 our thoughts!\n\nSome drinks and snacks will be provided\, please do bring
  more to share!\nPizza will be ordered\, please do chip in if you partake 
 in delivered food!\n\nSaturday\, July 25th\, 6:00pm - 10:00pm\nOther Room 
 Theater\n715 N. Pine St.\nLancaster PA 17603\n\nWe can delay starting the 
 movie to give people time to arrive\, but no later than 6:30pm\, please tr
 y to arrive before then if you do not want to miss any of the movie.\n\nPI
 CTURED below is the main entrance\, the event space is right up the stairs
 . On street parking should be available\, several public parking lots such
  as behind CVS are within a 2 blocks walk along Harrisburg Pike.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 315462433/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260629T003434Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260629T003434Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
